<Document>
<name>Polished &amp; Pristine — 18-mile service area</name>
<description>18-mile straight-line coverage guide from a public Darlington reference point, not the owner's home. Postcode and service availability must be confirmed. Farther away? Get in touch.</description>
<Style id="coverage"><LineStyle><color>ffe75e31</color><width>3</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>30e75e31</color><fill>1</fill><outline>1</outline></PolyStyle></Style>
<Placemark>
<name>18-mile advertised service area</name>
<description>Polished &amp; Pristine Mobile. Coverage guide centred on Darlington (public reference point). Boundary calculated at 18 statute miles / 28,968.192 metres on the WGS84 ellipsoid; not a driving-distance boundary. We confirm coverage, quote and availability for your postcode. Outside this area? Contact us to discuss your location and service. No customer drop-off location is marked.</description>
